  },
  "fullText": {
    "simplified": "你可以教我吗？\n\n小雨：喂，您好！我是小雨。\n本：喂，小雨，我是本。你今天有时间吗？\n小雨：有啊。怎么了？\n本：我正在看HSK的书，有几题不会做，你可以教我吗？\n小雨：好啊。你在哪儿？\n本：我在图书馆。\n小雨：那我现在去图书馆找你。\n本：谢谢你。\n小雨：不客气。等会儿见。\n本：等会儿见。",
    "traditional": "你可以教我嗎？\n\n小雨：喂，您好！我是小雨。\n本：喂，小雨，我是本。你今天有時間嗎？\n小雨：有啊。怎麼了？\n本：我正在看HSK的書，有幾題不會做，你可以教我嗎？\n小雨：好啊。你在哪兒？\n本：我在圖書館。\n小雨：那我現在去圖書館找你。\n本：謝謝你。\n小雨：不客氣。等會兒見。\n本：等會兒見。"
  },
  "sentences": [
    {
      "index": 1,
      "simplified": "\n\n",
      "traditional": "\n\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Can You Teach Me?"
    },
    {
      "index": 2,
      "simplified": "小雨：喂，您好！我是小雨。",
      "traditional": "小雨：喂，您好！我是小雨。",
      "pinyin": "xiǎo yǔ wéi nín hǎo wǒ shì xiǎo yǔ",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 3,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Little Yu: Hello! This is Little Yu."
    },
    {
      "index": 4,
      "simplified": "本：喂，小雨，我是本。你今天有时间吗？",
      "traditional": "本：喂，小雨，我是本。你今天有時間嗎？",
      "pinyin": "běn wéi xiǎo yǔ wǒ shì běn nǐ jīn tiān yǒu shí jiān ma",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 5,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Ben: Hello, Little Yu. This is Ben. Do you have time today?"
    },
    {
      "index": 6,
      "simplified": "小雨：有啊。怎么了？",
      "traditional": "小雨：有啊。怎麼了？",
      "pinyin": "xiǎo yǔ yǒu a zěn me le",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 7,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Little Yu: I do. What's up?"
    },
    {
      "index": 8,
      "simplified": "本：我正在看HSK的书，有几题不会做，你可以教我吗？",
      "traditional": "本：我正在看HSK的書，有幾題不會做，你可以教我嗎？",
      "pinyin": "běn wǒ zhèng zài kàn 3 de shū yǒu jǐ tí bú huì zuò nǐ kě yǐ jiāo wǒ ma",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 9,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Ben: I'm looking at the HSK book, and there are a few problems I don't understand. Can you teach me?"
    },
    {
      "index": 10,
      "simplified": "小雨：好啊。你在哪儿？",
      "traditional": "小雨：好啊。你在哪兒？",
      "pinyin": "xiǎo yǔ hǎo a nǐ zài nǎ'r",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 11,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Little Yu: Ok. Where are you?"
    },
    {
      "index": 12,
      "simplified": "本：我在图书馆。",
      "traditional": "本：我在圖書館。",
      "pinyin": "běn wǒ zài tú shū guǎn",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 13,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Ben: I'm at the library."
    },
    {
      "index": 14,
      "simplified": "小雨：那我现在去图书馆找你。",
      "traditional": "小雨：那我現在去圖書館找你。",
      "pinyin": "xiǎo yǔ nà wǒ xiàn zài qù tú shū guǎn zhǎo nǐ",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 15,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Little Yu: Then I'll head to the library now to look for you."
    },
    {
      "index": 16,
      "simplified": "本：谢谢你。",
      "traditional": "本：謝謝你。",
      "pinyin": "běn xiè xie nǐ",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 17,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Ben: Thank you."
    },
    {
      "index": 18,
      "simplified": "小雨：不客气。等会儿见。",
      "traditional": "小雨：不客氣。等會兒見。",
      "pinyin": "xiǎo yǔ bú kè qi děng huì'r jiàn",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 19,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Little Yu: You're welcome. See you in a while."
    },
    {
      "index": 20,
      "simplified": "本：等会儿见。",
      "traditional": "本：等會兒見。",
      "pinyin": "běn děng huì'r jiàn",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 21,
      "simplified": "",
      "traditional": "",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Ben: See you in a while."
    }
